      see <a href="https://github.com/paritysuite/dynamodb-conformance/blob/main/NOTICE" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline hover:text-zinc-600 dark:hover:text-zinc-300">NOTICE</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
